<%# How a report becomes visible. Shown on the dashboard and the report menu. %>
<section class="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <h2 id="how-title" class="flush-top">How reporting works</h2>
  <ol class="how-steps">
    <li><strong>You report it</strong><span>With documented evidence. Defaults need the default notice you sent the business.</span></li>
    <li><strong>We review and notify</strong><span>FinDex checks the evidence and emails the reported party, who has 10 days to respond or dispute.</span></li>
    <li><strong>It&rsquo;s published</strong><span>Members who search that party see the report. Disputed reports are withheld while we review.</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>
